{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"TatNet Public API","description":"TatNet public REST API.\n\n**Authentication** — send your API key as a bearer token:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer tn_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\n```\n\nKeys are scoped to a single account and carry a subset of that account's\npermissions (and, optionally, a project allowlist). Mint and revoke keys from\nthe dashboard. The account is implicit from the key — endpoints never take an\n`account_id`.\n\n**Rate limit** — fixed window per key. On 429 the response includes a\n`Retry-After` header (seconds).\n\n**Errors** — non-2xx responses use the shape\n`{\"error\": {\"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\"}}`.","version":"1.0.0"},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.tatnet.ru/v1"}],"paths":{"/account":{"get":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Identify the calling API key","description":"Returns the account the API key belongs to, the key id, and the key's policy (the actions and resources it is allowed to act on).","operationId":"account_whoami","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WhoAmIResponse"}}}}},"security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}]}},"/account/balance":{"get":{"tags":["account"],"summary":"Read the account balance","description":"The balance of the account the key belongs to, as the billing service sees it at the moment of the request. Requires `billing:read`, which is governed by `account:view_billing` — held by account owners and admins. `503 billing_unavailable` means the balance could not be read; it is never reported as zero.","operationId":"account_get_balance","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1Balance"}}}}},"security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}]}},"/projects":{"get":{"tags":["projects"],"summary":"List projects","operationId":"projects_list_projects","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"minimum":1,"default":50,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"default":0,"title":"Offset"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Page_V1Project_"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}":{"get":{"tags":["projects"],"summary":"Get a project","operationId":"projects_get_project","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1Project"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/images":{"get":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"List images available to the project's account","operationId":"vms_list_images","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"cluster_id","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Cluster Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ImagesListResponse"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/vms":{"get":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"List VMs in a project","operationId":"vms_list_vms","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"minimum":1,"default":50,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"default":0,"title":"Offset"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Page_V1VM_"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Create a VM","operationId":"vms_create_vm","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1VMCreate"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1VM"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/vms/{vm_id}":{"get":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Get a VM","operationId":"vms_get_vm","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1VM"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Delete a VM","description":"202, and the body says which of the two things happened.\n\nA VM that was never provisioned is gone when this returns (``deleted``).\nA provisioned one is moved to ``deleting`` and a region tears it down over\nthe following minutes — it stays visible in ``GET …/vms`` until then, so a\nscript that deletes and immediately re-creates by name has to wait.\n\nThis used to answer 204, which could not express the difference; the\nservice's own return value cannot either (it reports ``success`` for both\nand puts the distinction in a human-readable message).","operationId":"vms_delete_vm","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}}],"responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DeleteAccepted"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/vms/{vm_id}/start":{"post":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Start a VM","operationId":"vms_start_vm","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"anyOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/VMStartRequest"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Body"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1PowerActionResult"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/vms/{vm_id}/stop":{"post":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Stop a VM","operationId":"vms_stop_vm","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1PowerActionResult"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/vms/{vm_id}/restart":{"post":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Restart a VM","operationId":"vms_restart_vm","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1PowerActionResult"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/vms/{vm_id}/backups":{"get":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"List VM backups","operationId":"vms_list_backups","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"minimum":1,"default":50,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"default":0,"title":"Offset"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Page_V1Backup_"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Create a VM backup","operationId":"vms_create_backup","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1BackupCreate"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/V1Backup"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/projects/{project_id}/vms/{vm_id}/backups/{backup_id}":{"delete":{"tags":["vms"],"summary":"Delete a VM backup","operationId":"vms_delete_backup","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"project_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Project Id"}},{"name":"vm_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Vm Id"}},{"name":"backup_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"Backup Id"}}],"responses":{"202":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DeleteAccepted"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/dns/zones":{"get":{"tags":["dns"],"summary":"List DNS zones","operationId":"dns_list_zones","security":[{"TatNetAPIKey":[]}],"parameters":[{"name":"status_filter","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Status Filter"}},{"name":"search","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Search"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":200,"minimum":1,"default":50,"title":"Limit"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","m